# NARID ATDC TRACKER
# NETWORK & LOCATION ACCESS CONTROL SYSTEM
## Complete Enterprise-Level Implementation Specification

### 1. PROJECT OBJECTIVE

Implement a new enterprise-level security module named:

**NETWORK & LOCATION ACCESS CONTROL**

This module will allow the Super Admin to control which network or geographical connectivity methods are authorized for every application role.

The Super Admin must have complete control over:
- Which Role can access the application.
- From which Public IP Address a Role can access.
- From which approved Address / Factory Location a Role can access.
- From which GPS Location a Role can access.
- Which connectivity conditions are mandatory.
- Whether multiple conditions use AND or OR logic.
- Which Network Groups are assigned to each Role.
- Whether access is permanent or temporary.
- Access requests and approvals.
- Security logs and alerts.
- Historical policy versions and restoration.

This must be a server-enforced security system, not just a frontend visibility restriction.

