# 10. MULTIPLE GROUP EVALUATION

A Role can have multiple assigned Network Groups.

Super Admin must be able to independently configure how those groups are evaluated.

Support:

- OR between groups.
- AND between groups.
- Custom nested AND / OR conditions where technically appropriate.

Example:

Production Role:

Group 1: Noida Plant
Group 2: Greater Noida Plant

Group 1 Policy:
IP AND GPS.

Group 2 Policy:
IP OR GPS.

Groups Combination:
OR.

Result:
Access is granted when at least one complete group policy passes.

Do not incorrectly evaluate a partially matching group as successful.

Show the complete policy tree in the Super Admin interface.

