### Approval Types

Support both:

A. PERMANENT APPROVAL

- Can be Role-wide.
- Adds the approved entry to the applicable Role connectivity policy.
- Remains active until Super Admin changes or removes it.
- Must create a policy audit entry.

B. TEMPORARY APPROVAL

- Can be Role-wide.
- Can be Requester Only.
- Must support configurable duration.

Suggested quick durations:
- 1 Hour.
- 8 Hours.
- 24 Hours.
- 7 Days.
- Custom Duration.

Temporary approval must automatically expire.

Expiry must be enforced by the backend even if no user is online.

After expiry:
- Remove authorization from effective policy evaluation.
- Revalidate existing sessions.
- Record an expiry event.
- Create the appropriate Security Log.

Temporary approval must not silently modify the permanent Role policy.

