# 23. TECHNICAL ARCHITECTURE AND BACKEND ENFORCEMENT

This is a critical security requirement.

Inspect the current NARID ATDC Tracker architecture before implementation.

Existing stack includes:
- React frontend.
- Express backend.
- Firebase Authentication.
- Firestore.
- Firebase Admin SDK.
- Vercel production deployment.

